---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="About and How We Review" description={`Who runs ${SITE.name}, how tools are selected and reviewed, and how the site makes money.`}>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'About', href: '/about/' }]} />
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is an independent directory of AI tools. The goal is simple: help you decide quickly whether a tool is
      worth your time, and point you to a better fit when it is not.
    </p>
    <h2>How we review</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every listing states what the tool is for, what it costs and who it suits, in plain language.</li>
      <li>Every listing includes real drawbacks. If we cannot name a weakness, we do not understand the tool yet.</li>
      <li>We do not publish star ratings or user reviews we cannot verify.</li>
      <li>Each page shows when it was last updated. Pricing changes often, so always confirm on the vendor's site.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we make money</h2>
    <p>
      The site is funded by advertising and affiliate commissions. Commissions never decide whether a tool is listed or
      what we say about it. Details are in our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Corrections and tool suggestions are welcome. <!-- TODO: add your contact email --></p>
  </article>
</Base>
